  "id": "empty-chair-technique",
  "term": "empty-chair technique",
  "definition": "The empty-chair technique is a Gestalt therapy method in which a person speaks in dialogue with an imagined other person or with a part of themselves. It is used to help bring out, examine, and work through emotions or inner conflicts.",
